# Requests a review from reidbaker-agent on every PR. Approval is not required because the ruleset does not require code-owner review.
* @reidbaker-agent

# Requests a review from reidbaker on every change to what users install: the Homebrew formula and its template, and the release workflows and the composite actions they use. The last matching line wins, so these files do not request reidbaker-agent.
/Formula/ @reidbaker
/release/templates/ @reidbaker
/.github/workflows/release_build_and_tag.yaml @reidbaker
/.github/workflows/release_publish.yaml @reidbaker
/.github/actions/ @reidbaker
